=== Notes ===

The [[Banc Balboa Tower]] and [[2215 Avinguda Embarcadero, Sant Cristòfor|2215 Avinguda Embarcadero]] share the same architectural height of 205 metres. The residential tower ranks above the office tower because its roof height is greater: 2215 Avinguda Embarcadero reaches 205 metres to its roof, while the Banc Balboa Tower's roof is 190 metres, with the remaining 15 metres formed by its architectural crown.

